  "summary": "Software Engineer with significant experience in all phases of the software development life cycle including requirement gathering, design, implementation, test, and maintenance \n-Proven success record in developing small to large scale applications using object-oriented analysis and design methods\n-Analytical thinker with excellent interpersonal skills who works well with others\n-Adept at learning and applying new concepts, technologies, and methodologies\n-Strong background in software development with proficiency in multiple programming languages\n-DoD Top Secret / SCI cleared",
