    "description": "-Ported a large WPF provisioning system on to the web using angularjs, wcf, twitter bootstrap, and the nhibernate. \n-Designed and developed a web service for monitoring critical services, which included automated notification, metric gathering and trending, on a diverse set of platforms that resulted in a significant reduction in system down time\n-Performed root cause analysis and defect resolution on a highly complex, large system composed of multiple languages and platforms on a team utilizing the Kanban methodology\n-Designed and developed core mission components of the GeoEye satellite command and control system using the Horizon C# framework and agile-based development practices\n-Designed and developed mission critical software components of AEHF satellite command and control system\n-Performed domain expert role for key mission command and control components\n-Developed user interfaces, frameworks, functional process logic, and data access applications in multiple baseline environment \n-Produced unit level test documents used for verification and validation of component functionality\n-Defined evaluation criteria for system level engineering requirements and developed test documents\n-Increased team productivity by identifying and developing scripts and WPF applications to streamline environment setup and common process execution\n-Re-factored defective code to satisfy defined mission requirements, including real-time performance based criteria, within an aggressive schedule\n-Supported multiple inter-segment system test events as a on-site point of contact and as a test conductor\n-Awarded the AEHF MCS Exceptional Performance Award 2005, 2006, 2007, 2009, and multiple SPOT Awards for Outstanding Individual Effort Contributing to Mission Success",
